<svg class="diagram-svg" viewBox="0 0 600 270" role="img" aria-labelledby="ctnecessarysufficient-title ctnecessarysufficient-desc" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <title id="ctnecessarysufficient-title">Euler diagram of a sufficient and a necessary condition</title>
  <desc id="ctnecessarysufficient-desc">Inside the rectangle of all integers, a large region holds the even integers and a smaller region inside it holds the multiples of 6. The number 12 lies in both regions, the number 4 lies in the even region only, and the number 9 lies outside both. Because the smaller region is entirely inside the larger one, being a multiple of 6 is sufficient for being even, and being even is necessary for being a multiple of 6. The number 4 shows that being a multiple of 6 is not necessary for being even.</desc>
  <defs>
    <marker id="ctnecessarysufficient-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path class="arrowhead" d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" />
    </marker>
  </defs>
  <rect class="ln" x="10" y="10" width="580" height="250" rx="4" />
  <text class="small" x="22.0" y="30.0" text-anchor="start">All integers</text>
  <ellipse class="region" cx="250" cy="140" rx="200" ry="100" />
  <ellipse class="ln" cx="250" cy="140" rx="200" ry="100" />
  <text x="250.0" y="62.0" text-anchor="middle">Even integers (<tspan class="var">Y</tspan>)</text>
  <ellipse class="region" cx="220" cy="152" rx="92" ry="54" />
  <ellipse class="ln" cx="220" cy="152" rx="92" ry="54" />
  <text x="220.0" y="140.0" text-anchor="middle">Multiples of 6</text>
  <text x="220.0" y="158.0" text-anchor="middle">(<tspan class="var">X</tspan>)</text>
  <circle class="dot" cx="220" cy="182" r="4" />
  <text class="small" x="232.0" y="186.0" text-anchor="start">12</text>
  <circle class="dot" cx="370" cy="140" r="4" />
  <text class="small" x="382.0" y="144.0" text-anchor="start">4</text>
  <circle class="dot" cx="520" cy="200" r="4" />
  <text class="small" x="532.0" y="204.0" text-anchor="start">9</text>
  <text class="small" x="522.0" y="80.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="var">X</tspan> is sufficient for <tspan class="var">Y</tspan></text>
  <text class="small" x="522.0" y="98.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan class="var">Y</tspan> is necessary for <tspan class="var">X</tspan></text>

</svg>
